        94.37739562988281,
        192.18212890625
      ],
      "text": "C",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.5873031616211,
        179.3329315185547,
        268.61627197265625,
        191.1321258544922
      ],
      "text": "ase and outcome definitions",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        199.87493896484375,
        513.47216796875,
        213.2264404296875
      ],
      "text": "This section describes the recently revised definitions of TB cases, their classification and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        215.80245971679688,
        274.5938720703125,
        229.22296142578125
      ],
      "text": "(1) the treatment outcome categories .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        240.10198974609375,
        513.4835815429688,
        253.7294921875
      ],
      "text": "Presumptive TB  refers to a patient who presents with symptoms or signs suggestive of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        256.37451171875,
        275.9163513183594,
        269.72601318359375
      ],
      "text": "TB (previously known as a TB suspect).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        280.88104248046875,
        513.403076171875,
        294.2325439453125
      ],
      "text": "Bacteriologically confirmed or clinically diagnosed cases of TB (Box A2.1) are also",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        296.8775634765625,
        199.21141052246094,
        310.22906494140625
      ],
      "text": "classified according to:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        319.3312072753906,
        258.07940673828125,
        333.2632141113281
      ],
      "text": "anatomical site of disease;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        339.731201171875,
        274.97540283203125,
        353.6632080078125
      ],
      "text": "history of previous treatment;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        360.1311950683594,
        204.535400390625,
        374.0632019042969
      ],
      "text": "drug resistance;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        380.5312194824219,
        175.41140747070312,
        394.4632263183594
      ],
      "text": "HIV status. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        151.5793914794922,
        421.0432434082031,
        260.26336669921875,
        435.26324462890625
      ],
      "text": "TB case definitions",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88740539550781,
        421.33123779296875,
        151.5793914794922,
        435.26324462890625
      ],
      "text": "Box A2.1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        448.6531982421875,
        493.16192626953125,
        465.6632080078125
      ],
      "text": "A bacteriologically confirmed TB case is one from whom a biological specimen is  ·",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        463.6332092285156,
        493.1219177246094,
        478.6332092285156
      ],
      "text": "positive by smear microscopy, culture or WHO-approved rapid diagnostics (such as",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        477.6332092285156,
        493.1318359375,
        492.6332092285156
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF). All such cases should be notified, regardless of whether TB treatment",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        491.6332092285156,
        175.6519012451172,
        506.6332092285156
      ],
      "text": "has started.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        513.1531982421875,
        493.13177490234375,
        530.1632080078125
      ],
      "text": "TB case A clinically diagnosed  is one who does not fulfil the criteria for bacteriological  ·",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        528.1331787109375,
        493.1918029785156,
        543.1331787109375
      ],
      "text": "confirmation but who has been diagnosed with active TB by a clinician or other medical",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        542.1331787109375,
        493.17193603515625,
        557.1331787109375
      ],
      "text": "practitioner who has decided to give the patient a full course of TB treatment. This",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        556.1331787109375,
        493.161865234375,
        571.1331787109375
      ],
      "text": "definition includes cases diagnosed on the basis of X-ray abnormalities or suggestive",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        570.1331787109375,
        493.15185546875,
        585.1331787109375
      ],
      "text": "histology and extrapulmonary cases without laboratory confirmation. Clinically",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        584.1331787109375,
        493.201904296875,
        599.1331787109375
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed cases subsequently found to be bacteriologically positive (before or after",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.72189331054688,
        598.533203125,
        430.53192138671875,
        613.533203125
      ],
      "text": "starting treatment) should be reclassified as bacteriologically confirmed.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        639.8551025390625,
        374.4793395996094,
        656.5831298828125
      ],
      "text": "Classification based on anatomical site of disease",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        663.318603515625,
        513.4605102539062,
        676.9461059570312
      ],
      "text": "Pulmonary TB (PTB)  refers to any bacteriologically confirmed or clinically diagnosed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        679.5911254882812,
        513.368408203125,
        692.942626953125
      ],
      "text": "case of TB involving the lung parenchyma or the tracheobronchial tree. Miliary TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        695.587646484375,
        513.4835205078125,
        708.9391479492188
      ],
      "text": "is classified as PTB because there are lesions in the lungs. Tuberculous intrathoracic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        711.5841064453125,
        513.426025390625,
        724.9356079101562
      ],
      "text": "lymphadenopathy (mediastinal and/or hilar) or tuberculous pleural effusion, without",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        727.5806274414062,
        513.471923828125,
        740.93212890625
      ],
      "text": "radiographic abnormalities in the lungs, constitutes a case of extrapulmonary TB. A",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        743.5771484375,
        513.41455078125,
        756.9286499023438
      ],
      "text": "patient with both pulmonary and extrapulmonary TB should be classified as a case of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        759.5736083984375,
        109.327392578125,
        772.9251098632812
      ],
      "text": "PTB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        553.0839233398438,
        805.8439331054688,
        586.4439086914062,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "109",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
